Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.81,Hdr,,0,0,0,,April 27, 1997 - Tenno Sho (Spring)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Round the final turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:07.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Big Symbol leads - outside him, last year's champion Sakura Laurel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tracking him, Marvelous Sunday breaks clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:15.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,And on the far outside, Mayano Top Gun - held up today - unleashes his kick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,He charges home, reeling in the two in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sakura Laurel and Marvelous Sunday in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mayano Top Gun flying down the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:28.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mayano Top Gun takes over - Sakura Laurel second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mayano Top Gun wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:38.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mayano Top Gun storms from the back to win the battle of the Big Three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:42.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,A stunning finish from an unexpected hold-up ride